From: Developer
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026
Subject: [PATCH] add Build.VERSION.BASE_OS for NewPipe ErrorActivity

NewPipe ErrorActivity.getOsString() reads Build.VERSION.BASE_OS on
API 23+. ATL lacked the field, so showing an ACRA report aborted ART
with NoSuchFieldError.

--- a/src/api-impl/android/os/Build.java
+++ b/src/api-impl/android/os/Build.java
@@ -186,6 +186,10 @@
 		public static final int RESOURCES_SDK_INT;
 
 		public static final String SECURITY_PATCH = getString("ro.build.version.security_patch");
+
+		public static final String BASE_OS = getString("ro.build.version.base_os");
+
+		public static final int PREVIEW_SDK_INT = 0;
 	}
 
 	/**
